ck threaded portion scoring.\r\n - Check light liquid chamber fitting portion damage.\r\n - Check O -ring groove damage, deformation.\r\n - Check knock pin groove damage, deformation.\r\n10. Main seal ring:\r\n - Inspect seal surface damage, deterioration.\r\n - Inspect seal surface dimension.\r\n11. Deformation inspection:\r\n - Distributor keyway deformation.\r\n - Threaded portion damage.\r\n - Knock pin deformation.\r\n12. Inspect various types of O -rings of bowl for deterioration, cracks, wear.\r\n13. Main cylinder:\r\n - Check main seal ring seal surface damage, wear, corrosion.\r\n - Check bowl body sliding portion damage, wear, peeled plating.\r\n - Check O -ring groove contamination.\r\n14. Pilot valve:\r\n - Check damage for bowl body sliding portion.\r\n - Check valve sheet seat surface damage, deformation, foreign substances caught.\r\n15. Light liquid chamber:\r\n - Check contamination, worn threaded portion, corrosion.\r\n16. Heavy liquid chamber:\r\n - Check contamination, corrosion, cracks.\r\n17. Gravity disc:\r\n - Check contamination, corrosion, cracks.\r\n18. Bowl bush:\r\n - Check contact with bowl.\r\n19. Drain nozzle check clogging.\r\n20 . Vertical shaft:\r\n - Check upper portion (above bearing (1)) for corrosion, wear.\r\n - Threaded portion damage.\r\n - Pinion tooth surface wear.\r\n21. Water supplying system:\r\n - Check operating water nozzle and chamber for contamination, clogged drilled hole, damage.\r\n - Check O -ring for damage, deterioration, deformation.\r\n22. Solenoid valve:\r\n - Check leakage of seal part .\r\n23. Reducing valve:\r\n - Check leakage of seal part .\r\n - Check pressure gauge pressure indication\r\n24. Check multi monitor alarm functions .	SAFETY PROCEDURE (COMPANY)\r\n===========================\r\nEnsure compliance with safety procedures according to the company policy and requirements.\r\n\r\nJOB REFERENCE DETAILS\r\n===================\r\nManual Name: 8M-3 INSTRUCTION MANAUL FOR PURIFIER;5303.pdf\r\nPdf Pa